23
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:03,480
Igatahes, tõde on see, et...

24
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:03,480
Corvette' ei ole kunagi olnud konkurendivõimeline.

25
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,440
parimale, mida

26
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,440
