111
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,160
-(MOOTORID KÄIVITUVAD)

112
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,160
-Kolm, kaks, üks...

113
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,320
Mine!

114
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,360
(rehvid hõikavad)

115
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:32,920
Ja siin me oleme. Nagu ma ütlesin,

116
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:32,920
