117
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,800
Aga siin on asi.

118
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,800
Omadelt vaadates,

119
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:43,600
Cayman GTS on...

120
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:43,600
