Nojah, see on üsna eriline sündmus.

187
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,800
(rehvid hõikavad)

188
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,640
Kogu see jõud...

189
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,640
