224
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Ma olen sinuga nõus...

225
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Tegelikult, teisel korral.

226
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
minu elus olen ma sinuga nõus.

227
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
Mis, sa ei kavatse seda öelda?

228
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
Minu nimi on Billy Bob Hammond.

229
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
