230
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
-Ei, ja ma ei kavatse seda ka.

231
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
Ma ei maini seda jakki, ei.

232
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
– Kas sa ei ole?

233
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
Ei, ma tean, ma tean.

234
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
kui sa tahad, et ma seda teen.

235
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
aga ma ei tee seda.

236
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,600
Ma ütlen sulle, mida ma kavatsen teha.

237
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,600
ma tegelikult kavatsen teha.

238
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,600
ma küsin sulle seda.

239
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,520
Millest neist kahest?

240
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,520
