983
00:28:58,120 --> 00:29:00,120
Mis?

984
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
Oodake, meie oma radad on ka…

985
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
McLareni oma raja. Seal see toimub.

986
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
seal nad asju arendavad.

987
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Jah, ma tean.

988
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ja ma tean, et...

989
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ma tean ka, et nemad seda teavad.

990
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
need need nendes pisidetailides.

991
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
ja nii edasi.

992
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:14,240
sobib hästi.

993
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:14,240
nelikvedu.

994
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:14,240
Porsche'i puhul.

995
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:16,320
Olgu. Me teeme seda.

996
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:16,320
teisel ringrajal.

997
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:18,320
Noh, see viib meid teise probleemini.

998
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:18,320
teise probleemini.

999
00:29:18,360 --> 00:29:22,600
Ferrari on viimased kuud...

1000
00:29:18,360 --> 00:29:22,600
Kuus kuud on möödas, kui nad ütlevad: "Ei."

1001
00:29:18,360 --> 00:29:22,600
– me ei taha seda üldse teha.

1002
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:26,200
-"Sest me ei ole selles üldse huvitatud."

